Coder: make the TUI thread execute one readable loop dispatching termination, due member callbacks, application updates, and terminal input through the agreed owners. Process both input and notifications when ready, service buffered decoded input before sleeping, centralize painting/invalidation, and migrate actual deadlines rather than retaining hidden polling loops. Respect signal/cancellation, readiness error/hangup, and producer-lifetime contracts. Compile the integrated project; do not make passing tests an acceptance gate.
